  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "launch multiple strikes within range and gain Invigoration buff state",
    "skill1": "three-hit consecutive strikes; chain lightning to nearby during buff",
    "skill2": "AoE lightning burst available only while buffed",
    "skill3": "battle ATK increase",
    "skill4": "permanent buff state; buff activations stack ATK bonus",
    "skill5": "lightning AoE also stuns enemies"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Valen]] launches multiple strikes within range, then enters a permanent **Invigoration state** that defines his rotation. Three-hit strikes chain lightning to nearby foes while buffed, and another skill delivers AoE lightning only during that state. Repeated buff activations stack ATK, compounding personal damage through the fight, while the lightning AoE adds stun control. [[Valen]] is a buff-gated damage dealer who needs Invigoration uptime and grouped enemies; spread lines shrink both the chain and stun payoff.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Valen]] is invincible while striking, then rides Invigoration into chain lightning and an AoE stun that stacks ATK. Do not burst during the invincible cast; spread so forked lightning wastes targets and wait for the soft window after it ends. Catch the ultimate wind-up with [[Lily May]], then pressure [[Valen]] with Magic melee like [[Eironn]] or lasting coverage like [[Shemira]]."
}
